        <p class="how-body">Any sanctioned store can host a Shards Event. Play Swiss rounds, earn Shard Points based on your placement and the event's attendance. Your best four results count toward your season total.</p>
        <span class="pill pill-shards">Shards Event</span>
      </div>

      <div class="how-card">
        <div class="how-number">02</div>
        <h3 class="how-title">Win an Infinity Qualifier</h3>
        <p class="how-body">Six Infinity Qualifiers are held each season at designated partner stores. Win one and you claim that event's Infinity Stone — a guaranteed seat at the Championship, no standings required.</p>
        <span class="pill pill-qualifier" style="border-color: var(--reality);">Infinity Qualifier</span>
      </div>

      <div class="how-card">
        <div class="how-number">03</div>
        <h3 class="how-title">Qualify via Shard Standings</h3>
        <p class="how-body">Can't make it to a Qualifier? The top Shard Point holders who don't already hold a Stone earn at-large invitations to the Championship. Up to ten at-large spots are available.</p>
        <span class="pill pill-shards">At-Large</span>
      </div>

      <div class="how-card">
        <div class="how-number">04</div>
        <h3 class="how-title">The Infinity Gauntlet Championship</h3>
        <p class="how-body">The season culminates in an invitational Championship — six Stone holders seeded in, up to ten at-large qualifiers rounding out the field. The winner claims the Infinity Gauntlet trophy.</p>
        <span class="pill pill-championship">Championship</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
